ripting and CI pipelines.\\n- Code Snippets: 101\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 55.4\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor (llmstxt)\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /llmstxt/cursor-llms-full.txt\\n- Description: Cursor provides tools for managing subscriptions, refunds, and invoices, with various pricing plans for individual and team users based on usage and features.\\n- Code Snippets: 5861\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Go Cursor Help\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /yuaotian/go-cursor-help\\n- Description: A tool to reset Cursor IDE's free trial by modifying machine identifiers, supporting Windows, macOS, and Linux platforms.\\n- Code Snippets: 28\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 42.7\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor APIs\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /websites/cursor_api\\n- Description: Cursor APIs provide programmatic access to team data, AI-powered coding agents, analytics, and code tracking for enterprise teams and automated workflows.\\n- Code Snippets: 41\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Stats\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /dwtexe/cursor-stats\\n- Description: A Cursor extension that provides real-time monitoring of subscription usage, including fast requests and usage-based pricing information.\\n- Code Snippets: 2\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Scoot\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /mjrusso/scoot\\n- Description: Scoot is a macOS utility that provides fast, keyboard-driven control over the mouse pointer, enabling cursor teleportation and actuation through element-based or grid-based navigation.\\n- Code Snippets: 19\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: HumanCursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /riflosnake/humancursor\\n- Description: HumanCursor is a Python package that simulates realistic human mouse movements for web and system automation, designed to bypass bot detection.\\n- Code Snippets: 12\\n- Source Reputation: