e any version. 🚀\\n- Code Snippets: 213\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Memory Bank\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /vanzan01/cursor-memory-bank\\n- Description: A token-optimized, hierarchical task management system that integrates with Cursor custom modes for efficient development workflows.\\n- Code Snippets: 68\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Interactive User Feedback MCP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /noopstudios/interactive-feedback-mcp\\n- Description: A simple MCP Server that enables a human-in-the-loop workflow for AI-assisted development tools like Cursor, allowing users to run commands, view output, and provide textual feedback directly to the AI.\\n- Code Snippets: 9\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n----------\\n- Title: Figma Context MCP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /glips/figma-context-mcp\\n- Description: This server provides AI coding agents like Cursor with access to Figma design data, enabling accurate one-shot implementation of designs across various frameworks.\\n- Code Snippets: 40\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 65.4\\n----------\\n- Title: Scraper\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /rust-scraper/scraper\\n- Description: Scraper is a Rust library for HTML parsing and querying with CSS selectors, providing a browser-grade interface to Servo's `html5ever` and `selectors` crates.\\n- Code Snippets: 38\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 77.8\\n----------\\n- Title: PHP-Scoper\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /humbug/php-scoper\\n- Description: PHP-Scoper is a tool designed to move any body of code, including its vendor dependencies, into a new and distinct namespace to prevent conflicts, especially when building PHARs that bundle their own dependencies.\\n- Code Snippets: 35\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 92.4\\n----------\\n- Title: vmulti-mice\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /kolyn090/vmulti-mice\\n- Description: This project 